  "cards": [
    {
      "items": [
        "submit_plan stores immutable snapshot, version, round and evaluation ticket before evaluation; Maker draft/upload use API.",
        "HTTP path uses MockVLMProvider. Timeout/error/malformed output routes to review; the rules engine validates evidence/schema and budget deterministically.",
        "Checker decision requires assignment; rejection needs a reason. Resubmission creates a new version/round. HTTP auto-approval is off by default; seed enables a scenario.",
        "Code: src/backend/api/app.py · src/backend/application/workflow.py · src/backend/rules/decision.py · src/ai_pipeline/orchestrator.py · src/backend/seed_demo.py"
      ],
      "title": "CODE · HTTP demo",
      "dot": "emerald"
    },
    {
      "items": [
        "README/scope describe Local VLM plus dedicated Media Compliance and Strategy Feasibility agents; HTTP currently uses MockVLMProvider, and LocalVLM inference is not configured.",
        "Production authentication is not implemented. Sources: README.md · docs/scope-phase-1.md · src/ai_pipeline/providers/openai_provider.py"
      ],
      "title": "DOC · not separate runtime steps",
      "dot": "amber"
    }
